Storms repository 
This repository was created as a practical exercise tutorial #4 in efforts of teaching students to become more verse with Git/GitHub's collaborative branching workflow
Steps Followed to Complete the Tutorial
1. Starting a public GitHub repository.
2. Created an initial README file to activate the repository.
3. Created a new branch named `assignment-branch`.
4. Added a custom file containing first and last names.
5. Committed the file changes to the new branch.
6. Opened a Pull Request to merge the changes into the main branch.
7. Assigned StormNumber2 as the reviewer.
8. Waited for review approval from the collaborator.
9. Successfully merged the approved branch back into main.
Collaborators: DynastyStormz-ai (Main Dev), StormNumber2 (Reviewer/ Collaborator)
